# Sudan Economic Observatory — Full Website Specification

## 1. Project Name
Sudan Economic Observatory (SEO)

## 2. Purpose
Build a frontend-first economic data governance and analytics platform for Sudan.

The website is not just a dashboard. It is a structured system for:
- storing Sudan economic datasets
- validating extracted data
- preserving source provenance
- approving datasets before publication
- supporting rollback
- exploring trade, market, and economic indicators
- building a long-term economic data archive

## 3. Core Philosophy
The system must follow these rules:

- deterministic data ingestion only
- no AI-generated economic values
- no OCR guessing
- no fabricated balancing rows
- no silent correction of totals
- every number must have a source
- every observation must preserve provenance
- extracted data must go to draft first
- validation is required before approval
- approval is rule-scoped
- rollback must be safe and preserve history

## 4. Current Architecture
Frontend-only app.

Technology:
- HTML
- CSS
- Vanilla JavaScript
- localStorage persistence
- static hosting
- no backend
- no database
- no authentication in current phase

Current storage keys:
- seo_obs_v2
- seo_mp_v1
- seo_forum_v2

## 5. Main Website Sections

