Shows:
- key economic indicators
- trade balance summary
- exports/imports totals
- latest approved datasets
- data quality status
- available modules

### B. Foreign Trade Explorer
Core module.

Allows users to explore:
- exports
- imports
- trade balance
- annual data
- quarterly data
- monthly data
- commodity-level data

